{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>文章來源：Qooah.com</p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/643623345243534265.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"502\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b775e5398d695ca7e768df404c32fd4f1d2baf84b66dbd51733329c14c51d049/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2F5aae8692bd40247754b13adcfc32ef94\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>HONOR 把 Magic9 Pro Max 帶到香港，這也是該款旗艦在中國內地以外的首個上市地區。整場發布採用電影首映的活動形式，除播放由馮德倫使用這台手機拍攝的短片《SIGNAL 暗號》，現場亦陳列 ARRI 經典電影攝影機，搭配金像獎美術指導文念中打造的電影場景展區，讓與會者實際感受手機完整的影像錄製與收音實力。</p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/32767238763867983.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"593\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/139fcb7fecb4be293edefb06561714ac51135d61bb8fd098cfa92ebeae9fa68a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2F577d3615217c1ee119a627314d7e60c3\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>HONOR Magic9 Pro Max 核心賣點來自與百年電影器材品牌 ARRI 深度聯合調校的雙 2 億像素影像系統。機身後置 2 億像素雲台級主攝以及同規格 2 億像素超夜神長焦，兩顆鏡頭均搭載 OIS 光學防手震，達到 CIPA 8.0 防手震水準，分別配備 1/1.28 吋與 1/1.4 吋感光元件；另外搭配一顆 5,000 萬像素超廣角鏡頭，前置則為 5,500 萬像素、可支援方形畫面的自拍鏡頭。</p><p></p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/35657826828767633.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"568\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f22a6e9ad2ccf2b61638d7567f1a95b77c0ef4aced8bed75f0711dfcf7f5b4ff/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2F8c86108d68fccd022dc99ba866f0dc01\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>機內搭載 6nm 工藝自研馭光 H1 影像晶片，可直接對 RAW 檔作即時 AI 降噪處理，提升訊噪比，實現 14 級電影動態範圍。手機完整導入 ARRI LogC3 曲線、10 位元色深與 ARRI 超廣色域，專屬 ARRI 電影模式提供類專業攝影機操作介面，支援 2.39:1 超寬電影畫幅，最高可錄製 4K 60fps 影片，內置數十組 ARRI Look 色彩預設。同時搭載 APV 編解碼技術，在維持畫質前提下，相比 ProRes 節省約兩成儲存空間。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/237823692923873832.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"578\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8e9b87e949a13e1779328c432687fad76e05535019ed657a7dd0b69830089c78/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2F9286a2bc06e4c7db626c0b09d2d51492\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>除畫面之外，這台手機亦重視錄音品質，搭載由一支定向咪高峰搭配三支全向咪高峰組成的四混合麥克風陣列，即品牌所稱的電影槍咪級收音，能夠隔離偏離主方向的雜音，最遠可對 20 米距離的目標收音，同時內建多組收音預設，適合訪談、現場活動等不同錄音場景，音訊系統亦取得 SGS 五星音響認證。</p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/6432542356234523.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"550\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2b8e43dec111519ff75738bba39a179d3436ecde52317581b8e86f342675002a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2Fdfa132f636ffd45534be431ba5a2e7ed\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>性能層面，HONOR Magic9 Pro Max 搭載 Snapdragon 8 Elite Extreme Gen 6 處理器，配備 Butterfly VC 2.0 散熱結構，維持長時間高負載影像運算與遊戲場景的穩定輸出。</p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/236787823892632923.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"567\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a727e2d67245fb70a21c72ca80b37089f37a5646eb4910f38cb62794624faa38/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2F87ac69618ddf38aae5561146bb87e374\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>屏幕配置 6.8吋 LTPO OLED 面板，採用金剛巨犀玻璃與低反射鍍膜，屏幕反光壓低至 1.5%，峰值亮度達 10,000nit，戶外取景時可以更精準預覽畫面曝光。</p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2486932982703732.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"580\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/60925e17390e4e97f4ad56171a67fad9074e2f1827fc95f062353f2d91c4d617/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2F88a62db12ab9806c7a56dafcdea014fa\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>電池容量 8,000mAh，支援 100W 有線以及 80W 無線超級快充，搭載第三代 C3 射頻增強晶片強化網絡適應力，機身支援 IP68、IP69、IP69K 多項防護等級，適合戶外拍攝環境。</p><p>系統搭載 MagicOS 11，實體 AI 快捷按鍵可以快速喚起各類 AI 工具，機內預裝 Google Gemini，實現跨文字、影像的輔助處理，相機亦配置獨立快捷拍攝鍵。HONOR Connect 跨設備功能實現與 Apple Watch、AirPods、Insta360 等裝置的互連，還兼容 AirDrop 檔案分享機制，部分功能需要透過後續 OTA 更新開放。</p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/765435467867768.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"568\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e3e2efaff125d99c906dc9176c2fcae25c9d486d0f85c9d42994fc4c496abb20/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2Faa9faac89b6d3fc769e059008cb95a66\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>配色方面提供苔青、銀鹽、影黑三種選擇，12GB+512GB 版本三色齊全，售價 HKD10,999；16GB+1TB 僅有苔青與銀鹽，定價 HKD14,999。預訂期從 11 月 5 日到 11 月 18 日，消費者可以在官方體驗店、特約經銷商以及網上平台下單，11 月 18 日開始陸續取機。預購用戶可以二選 G200 長焦增距鏡套裝或是 1,000 港元超市禮券，再加上延長保養、意外屏幕保障、電量保固、免費貼膜以及 Google AI Pro 會員等全套福利，禮品合計總價最高達 5,200 港元。</p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/6372876832893289732.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"581\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f9eff143d7cf3ca2d82aae1b012a027c5782b1f30b4c7baabab655270f4870fe/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2F730b2f1ac16a9e44bf962f2c2d9483e7\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>發布現場亦同步展出多款 HONOR CHOICE 生態新品，覆蓋智能戒指、音頻眼鏡、手錶、小型家電等不同品類，豐富整個 AIoT 產品陣容。</p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/67544336575869.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"584\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b9370536d50c40e574a12783c4fab95a1f02058c41eae2bf0435ee9c1233fe17/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2Fed478707a17b15a52cf8251e23c2cabf\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>用戶還可以另外選購 G200、G500 增距鏡以及專業兔籠套件，進一步拓展戶外拍攝的創作邊界。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T17:25:31.799003+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1612,"images":10,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T13:58:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T17:58:57.170773+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T17:18:43.214019+00:00","content_hash":"dae6fe028ce01b7f62fd7d11a2a101dcf426f4e03ea7deaab00251966bf82c33","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}